even days, to build a new friendship with the formerly selfish and haughty ruler who once ordered Shirayuki to become his concubine. Along the way, Shirayuki is bound to run into trouble once again, as she is sought by a mysterious boy named Kazuki, someone she has never met.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["赤髪の白雪姫 2ndシーズン",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-59620":"2024-05-29T12:02:25Z","serial-25457":"2020-05-06T01:55:42Z","serial-23073":"2020-02-23T09:14:53Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-59620","serial-25457","serial-23073"],"relatedMalIds":[30123],"rating":7.97,"relations":[{"id":30123,"relation":"prequel"}],"availableEpisodeCount":24}]}